{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02553","headline":"奉和仪鸾殿早秋应制 · 许敬宗","name":"奉和仪鸾殿早秋应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"睿想追嘉豫，临轩御早秋。\n斜晖丽粉壁，清吹肃朱楼。\n高殿凝阴满，雕窗艳曲流。\n小臣参广宴，大造谅难酬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02553.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02553","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}